      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Dependency changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Now depends on lifecycle <code>2.2.0-rc02</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/c378b9a2eae63d2701c82b0144af36e33d15c26a..45b11795d6737dd540ccedaec026dc34397f1ba6/lifecycle/lifecycle-viewmodel-savedstate"
