      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Dependency changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Navigation now depends on androidx.lifecycle <code>2.2.0-rc02</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/c378b9a2eae63d2701c82b0144af36e33d15c26a..b0b973c9bc89f9ad3efe3c06e41b72957f032a99/navigation"
    },
    {
      "id": "sharetarget",
      "name": "Sharetarget",
      "version": "1.0.0-beta02",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/sharetarget#1.0.0-beta02",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>When converting ShortcutInfos to ChooserTargets for backwards compatibility, sort shortcuts based on the given rank.</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/cd1aae0250ae03f6383bf4fd28a60036778bb509..3c455c01a83d0598e2e6a014d8f1b490d0a39170/sharetarget"
    },
    {
      "id": "sqlite",
      "name": "SQLite",
      "version": "2.1.0-alpha01",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/sqlite#2.1.0-alpha01",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>API changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Added a new property to <code>SupportSQLiteOpenHelper.Configuration</code> called <code>useNoBackupDirectory</code> to indicate that a file based database should be created and located from the no backup directory.</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/eace942fd0bbc3d2ee2ee3380ad48e2cfe8d6da9..0b58731e733ba8c3fd60fb2edf2806d134dc19c9/sqlite"
    },
    {
      "id": "webkit",
      "name": "Webkit",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/webkit#1.1.0",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Important changes since 1.0.0</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Getter APIs to complement <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebView#setWebViewClient(android.webkit.WebViewClient)\">setWebViewClient()</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebView#setWebChromeClient(android.webkit.WebChromeClient)\">setWebChromeClient()</a>.</li>\n <li>ProxyController API to set a network request proxy for an app's WebViews.</li>\n <li>WebViewAssetLoader API to simplify loading APK assets, resources, and files from the app data directory via request interception. This allows access to web and local resources without disabling CORS.</li>\n <li>TracingController API to collect WebView tracing information for debugging purposes.</li>\n <li>RenderProcess APIs to manage WebView renderer services, and to detect when poorly behaved content causes WebView renderers to become unresponsive.</li>\n <li>Updated existing APIs to include nullability (<code>@NonNull</code>, <code>@Nullable</code>) and thread (<code>@UiThread</code>, <code>@WorkerThread</code>) annotations.</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/2a1fc7faf719ace396316bf287f3a2b06f446b86..40f75b8db6322d0cb774a33a826fc507b3b0b769/webkit"
    }
  ]
}
